    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmorbit is a minimalistic puzzle game where you click on celestial bodies to make them disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple. Celestial bodies without any orbiting bodies can be clicked and removed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the stage by removing the central celestial body last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no head-scratching difficulties. Enjoy it as a way to unwind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of Cosmorbit</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules that can be understood immediately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music and sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of stages and additional modes after clearing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark mode support</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmorbit is a minimalistic puzzle game where you click on celestial bodies to make them disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple. Celestial bodies without any orbiting bodies can be clicked and removed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the stage by removing the central celestial body last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no head-scratching difficulties. Enjoy it as a way to unwind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of Cosmorbit</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules that can be understood immediately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music and sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of stages and additional modes after clearing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark mode support</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Cosmorbit is a minimalistic celestial puzzle game. With simple controls, just click on the celestial bodies. It's not complicated. Relax and enjoy.",
